       },
       "estudio": "Det stämmer att investeringen kostar mycket. Samtidigt kan cykelvägen minska olyckor.",
       "alumno": "It's true that the investment costs a lot. At the same time, the cycle lane can reduce accidents.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
